.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class USER> void \fBcsmp::FluxEvaluator\fP< dim, USER >::Advective_O1_FluxesAndBalances (\fBElement\fP< dim > * const eptr) const"

.PP
computes F = (A_i vD \&. n_i) and its products with the upstream C0 on all facets, also computes FV flux balances Computes A_i vD \&. n_i for all facets and its product with the upstream concentrations\&. Stores 'facet flux' and 'facet flux concentration' product variables\&. Accumulates the flux balance and flux concentration balances in the corresponding node variables\&.

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
vD can be used directly as interstitial velocity since the FV is scaled by porosity

.PP
the thickness of lower-dimensional elements is taken into account

.PP
, assumes that the FV variables 'flux balance' and 'new concentration' were zeroed out before\&.
.RE
.PP
@tested OK SKM 17/8/19 
